{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/77aba761232c6bf1bdcdd9b9944ac7d2.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological thriller otome visual novel that blends romance, mystery, and slow-burn horror. Set in a beautifully haunting version of ancient Asia, it invites you to investigate, explore, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/53b663cb9b4dc2138849d4d9a0887d9f.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the serene yet unfamiliar Lotus Pavilion, with no memory of who you are or how you got there. Beside you is Han\u2014a gentle, soft-spoken artist who claims to be your husband. He insists you simply suffered a fall and lost your memory. Everything he does seems devoted to your comfort\u2026 but the more you explore your surroundings, the more unsettling things become. Is Han truly who he says he is? And more importantly\u2014who <i>are you</i>? 4 days is all you have to survive and find out the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/b61e47db15ba3ce9ff21c827868693a5.avif?t=1772328320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras_big/b61e47db15ba3ce9ff21c827868693a5.avif?t=1772328320 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/b57ac95da1ca244d2426597a13728e12.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Demo offers partial voice-acting. Support our Kickstarter to fund full voice-acting and more art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Customizable protagonist\u2019s name</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78A yandere love interest\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Point-and-click investigation and exploration mechanics where you can collect clues and make deductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78The game is designed to be highly replayable, with a lot of endings and non-linear branchings depending on your investigation and choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Beautiful anime-style CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Psychological thriller storytelling with a slow, creeping sense of dread and a richly atmospheric setting inspired by ancient Asia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Perfect for fans of otome games, yandere characters, and dark romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you trust the one who calls you his beloved\u2014or uncover the fate that truly awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo itself has 6 bad endings and 2 non-bad paths you can pursue. Let's see how many can you unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/9e2746aecf1b48428396962f36ea8cfe.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/8499db185016905a6127fc712a00ca71.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/a2b926951a008af35bd141db42f0de9d.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/2a73a25b9f9331af5b33a912b7b228fd.avif?t=1772328320\" width=566 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The base game is free and includes most of the romance endings, but we also offer an optional DLC that greatly expand the experience.</strong> The downloadable content pack unlock darker secrets, deeper relationships, and impactful new choices not available in the base game. If you enjoy the story, getting the DLC is also the best way to support me and our small team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccd Expansion Pack DLC</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a hidden area of the mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access new storylines and endings tied to this location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance a secret love interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional romantic choices you can choose during the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra romantic CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More dates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/91f7441c7cfa99e24fc0b635f8570899.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/1ec99adcb032d79bab7fcdeedabc4bb0.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=751 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/53f424e826ea09c4d4390b59fd2bc562.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=751 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/9ac1c8ccaa9dbcc3f733a69d2e52bf59.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=751 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/c6626b416a4e37dd1b5c9a701573ea3e.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/d310a2965ff8172447429094de0da345.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704230?t=1772328320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/8cf2c330f6772d4acb4c144228dd7fc0196e1409/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772328320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/15d644e36215021671dc1177cd227e54d5e49a78/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772328320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/15d644e36215021671dc1177cd227e54d5e49a78/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772328320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"n