e your husband. He insists you simply suffered a fall and lost your memory. Everything he does seems devoted to your comfort\u2026 but the more you explore your surroundings, the more unsettling things become. Is Han truly who he says he is? And more importantly\u2014who <i>are you</i>? 4 days is all you have to survive and find out the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/b61e47db15ba3ce9ff21c827868693a5.avif?t=1772328320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras_big/b61e47db15ba3ce9ff21c827868693a5.avif?t=1772328320 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704230/extras/b57ac95da1ca244d2426597a13728e12.avif?t=1772328320\" width=1560 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Demo offers partial voice-acting. Support our Kickstarter to fund full voice-acting and more art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Customizable protagonist\u2019s name</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78A yandere love interest\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Point-and-click investigation and exploration mechanics where you can collect clues and make deductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78The game is designed to be highly replayable, with a lot of endings and non-linear branchings depending on your investigation and choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Beautiful anime-style CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Psychological thriller storytelling with a slow, creeping sense of dread and a richly atmospheric setting inspired by ancient Asia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Perfect for fans of otome games, yandere ch